        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WSu1f",
          "x": 3280,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 03",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:03, reply 1. Regularization opens on his own Lecture 6 page with \"degree 12\" marked, and he guesses what the penalty does to the curve before anything is explained.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rdxeU",
          "x": 4880,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 04",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:04, reply 2. He picked B, sure 3. This reply has nothing new: prose, his answered guess with no tag, and a plain quiz, laid out like the shipped lesson.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JzliV",
          "x": 6480,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 05",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:05:30, reply 3. His quiz answer was right. The leash comes in as one line, and the plot shows only the leash until he guesses where the penalty puts a = 8.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "b8CUar",
          "x": 8080,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 06",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:06, three seconds after his answer. He picked A. The penalty line and the slider draw in, his guess card says what the penalty line gives, and the teacher writes reply 4.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "deuH1",
          "x": 9680,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 07",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:09:25. His right answer to reply 5's scaling quiz becomes the kept card, with the leash's fits and stops lines. No prose repeats it while the teacher writes the problem.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B5plel",
          "x": 11280,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 08",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:09:50. He clicked Drop this analogy. The card shrinks to his sentence, and the drop reaches the teacher with his next message.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eHOXG",
          "x": 12880,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 09",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:48. He solved the problem with one hint. That finishes Regularization, and at 48 minutes Stop here is the dark button while the teacher reads ahead for Cross-validation.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z0XtV",
          "x": 14480,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 10",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "21:49, after Stop here. The Midterm row says what is next and its Continue stays soft tonight, so Quiz 3 keeps the dark Start.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H1mIdk",
          "x": 16080,
          "y": 1116,
          "name": "Caption 11",
          "fill": "#24231f",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "Saturday 20:40. It is a new day, so the stopped row holds the dark Continue. Three topics are due and nothing on Today says so.",
          "lineHeight": 1.47,
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
